    "description": "The CAGE Alcohol Questionnaire (CAGE) is a 4-item screening tool used to identify signs of problematic alcohol use, covering feelings about cutting down, annoyance at criticism, guilt about drinking, and morning eye-openers. It is widely used in clinical settings as a rapid first-pass screen for alcohol dependence.",
